! v1.11.17 check: the textbook degenerate frontier (square H4, D4h:
! the HOMO/LUMO pair is exactly degenerate in RKS).  A CDFT charge
! constraint then stalls legitimately -- the new diagnostic must
! fire with the gap printout and the recommendations.
%method  PBE
%basis   3-21g
%grid    1
%job     energy
%scf_ptol 1e-7
%level_shift 0.2
%smearing fermi
%smearing_sigma 0.02
%cdft    becke
H1  1  charge  +0.4
%cdft_tol 1.0e-5
%cdft_maxiter 25
%rt_tddft 300
%rt_dt 0.05
%rt_pc_maxiter 6
%rt_print_every 100
%geom angstrom
H 0.0 0.0 0.0
H 1.2 0.0 0.0
H 1.2 1.2 0.0
H 0.0 1.2 0.0
*end
